  "contentHtml": "<p>암석 파트 복습용 수업입니다.</p><p>호잇 선생님이 올려주신 도레미마켓 PPT를 활용하여 암석송으로 가사 맞추기를 진행했습니다. (선생님 감사합니다:))</p><p><a href=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/cTdL/230\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/cTdL/230</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"Daum 카페\" data-og-description=\"\" data-og-host=\"cafe.daum.net\" data-og-source-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/cTdL/230\" data-og-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/_c21_/bbs_read?grpid=1TaBA&amp;fldid=cTdL&amp;datanum=230\" data-og-image=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\"><a href=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/cTdL/230\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/cTdL/230\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img src=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">Daum 카페</p><p class=\"og-desc\"></p><p class=\"og-host\">cafe.daum.net</p></div></a></div><p>암석송은 구버전인데, 신버전보다 중독성이 있어서 좋더라구요ㅎㅎ.. 애들이 한참을 따라 불렀습니다!&#160;</p><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IOarZl4V6jo\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IOarZl4V6jo</a></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IOarZl4V6jo\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"480\" data-video-height=\"360\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/cyptx6/hyVxsfd4Ro/HTdB1ZtpOq4kKPzOUcH6ek/img.jpg?width=480&amp;height=360&amp;face=0_0_480_360\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"480\" data-video-origin-height=\"360\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/IOarZl4V6jo\" width=\"480\" height=\"360\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1kTooaPZ6mjQbfk96uFtVhMT7VWMdwpgF?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1kTooaPZ6mjQbfk96uFtVhMT7VWMdwpgF?usp=sharing</a></p><p>수업에 사용한 PPT, 활동지, 영상을 담은 드라이브 링크 첨부합니다. 아이들과 재미있는 수업 되셨으면 좋겠습니다!</p><p>이번 학기도 모두들 홧팅하세요~!!</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
